AeonOS
===========

Getting Started
---------------

To get started with the AeonOS sources, you'll need to get familiar with Git and Repo.

To initialize your local repository, use command:

```
repo init -u https://github.com/AeonOS-AOSP/android.git -b lineage-23.0 --git-lfs
```

Then sync up:

```
repo sync
```

Building the System
-------------------

Initialize the ROM environment with the envsetup.sh script.

```
. build/envsetup.sh
```

Lunch your device after cloning all device sources if needed.

```
lunch lineage_codename-bp2a-buildtype
```

Start compilation

```
mka bacon
```
